    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:contributionTarget is functional: a Contribution relator credits exactly one WEMI entity at the tier that matches the credit, so a credit spanning two works is recorded as two Contributions rather than one relator pointing at several targets."@x-gmeow-english ;
